{"title":"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Cayley #9</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">2014 CEMC Fermat #8</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In a group of friends:\n</p>\n<ul style=\"list-style-type: disc;\">\n<li>Amy is taller than Carla</li>\n<li>Dan is shorter than Eric but taller than Bob</li>\n<li>Eric is shorter than Carla</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Who is the shortest?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/3/d/53da85b319c3e34f31872d7e1038ae966189c545.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\   \\text{Amy} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(B)}\\   \\text{Bob} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(C)}\\   \\text{Carla} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(D)}\\   \\text{Dan} \\qquad \t\\textbf{(E)}\\   \\text{Eric} \\qquad$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"502\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since Amy is taller than Carla, Amy cannot be the shortest. Carla also cannot be the shortest because Eric is shorter than Carla.\n</p><p>Eric cannot be the shortest because Dan is shorter than Eric, though Dan also isn't the shortest because Dan is taller than Bob.\n</p><p>Since no one else can be the shortest, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/4/fe4b8e8f2ce2f19bde3eb552fc4456e94a861d0c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf {(B) } \\text{Bob}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"77\" height=\"30\" /> is the shortest.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley\">2014 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">Problem 8</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 10\">Problem 10</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2014_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2014 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> 